msgstr "Wallpaper"

msgid "SETTINGS_WALLPAPER_HELP"
msgstr "Choose the wallpaper among the BMP files in /NILESWAN/WALLPAPERS (any name). Only valid pictures are listed: 224x144 pixels, 16 colors, uncompressed, at most 64 KB.\n\nThe selected picture is previewed behind the list; Right hides the list to see all of it."

msgid "SETTINGS_IMAGES_PREVIEW_KEY"
msgstr "Game images preview"

msgid "SETTINGS_IMAGES_PREVIEW_OFF"
msgstr "Off"

msgid "SETTINGS_IMAGES_PREVIEW_BACKGROUND"
msgstr "Background"

msgid "SETTINGS_IMAGES_PREVIEW_THUMBNAIL"
msgstr "Thumbnail"

msgid "SETTINGS_IMAGES_PREVIEW_HELP"
msgstr "Pictures of a game (up to 6, 224x144 BMP, like wallpapers) go in /NILESWAN/IMAGES/<file name without extension>/. Y3 (or Start > Images) shows them; IMG in the title bar tells how many there are.\n\nAfter stopping on the game for half a second:\nThumbnail: thumb.bmp of that folder (112x72, 16 colors) in a popup on the right (below in the vertical layout).\nBackground: the first picture behind the list.\nOff: nothing."

